OL,3,GNEWSARise in dementia cases needs      
OL,4,Aaction, charity says                   
OL,6,FThe growing number of people with      
OL,7,Fdementia in Jersey needs to be taken   
OL,8,F"really seriously", a charity lead has 
OL,9,Fsaid.                                  
OL,11,FThe island's mortality report showed   
OL,12,Fdementia and Alzheimer's disease deaths
OL,13,Fwere at the highest ever level, and the
OL,14,Fleading cause of death in 2025, when   
OL,15,Findividual cancers were recorded       
OL,16,Fseparately.                            
OL,18,FClaudine Snape, the chief executive of 
OL,19,Fthe charity Dementia Jersey, said the  
OL,20,Fisland needed to plan for the future to
OL,21,Fbe more "dementia-friendly".           
