OL,3,GNEWSARise in dementia cases needs      
OL,4,Aaction, charity says                   
OL,6,FThe government said it was developing a
OL,7,Fmore joined-up dementia service with   
OL,8,Fpartners including Dementia Jersey to  
OL,9,Fmake support easier to access.         
